This project calls, and does not copy, the following:
- pyloudnorm (MIT): ITU-R BS.1770 K-weighting, gating and loudness range.
- MoSQITo (Apache-2.0): ISO 532-1 loudness and DIN 45692 sharpness.

One file is under another licence: external/ecma418_2_worker.py imports sottek-hearing-model (AGPL-3.0-only) and is
offered under AGPL-3.0-only. listener starts it as a separate process and does not import it. See external/README.md.

Test signals and reference values of ISO 532-1, DIN 45692 and the EBU loudness test set are not part of this
repository. The conformance suite reads them from folders you name, and builds from their published descriptions the
cases that are defined by a formula.
